---
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import typists from '../assets/typists-room-1959.jpg';
---
<section id="problem" class="problem" aria-labelledby="problem-title">
  <div class="wrap grid problem__top" data-reveal-group>
    <h2 class="headline axis" id="problem-title" data-reveal="clip">The same three jobs, every week.</h2>
    <p class="lead axis problem__lead" data-reveal>
      None of it is difficult. It’s the same report, chaser and document, redone every week by someone with better things to do.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mosaic" data-reveal-group>
    <figure class="mosaic__photo" data-reveal="open">
      <Picture src={typists} formats={['avif', 'webp']} widths={[480, 800, 1200, 1600]} sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 50vw"
        alt="A 1959 office: rows of typists at desks with typewriters and stacks of paper, a supervisor handing over a document." loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption class="small">Head office typists’ room, New Zealand Railways, 1959. The typewriters went. A lot of the copying stayed.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <article class="pain pain--report" data-reveal>
      <div class="pain__art art-copy" data-loop data-ui aria-hidden="true">
        <ul class="art-copy__rows">
          <li>#4812 Customs hold</li><li>#4815 Invoice fixed</li><li>#4819 BL approved</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="art-copy__mail">
          <p>Weekly update</p>
          <i></i><i></i><i></i>
        </div>
        <div class="art-copy__track"><span class="art-copy__chip">Copy, paste</span></div>
      </div>
      <h3 class="title">The Friday report</h3>
      <p>Someone copies forty ticket updates into a client email, one tab at a time, and hopes nothing was missed.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="pain pain--chaser on-field" data-reveal>
      <div class="pain__art art-chase" data-loop data-ui aria-hidden="true">
        <ol class="art-chase__days"><li>Mon</li><li>Tue</li><li>Wed</li><li>Thu</li><li>Fri</li></ol>
        <span class="art-chase__now"></span>
        <div class="art-chase__draft">
          <p>Draft: KYC documents reminder</p>
          <div class="art-chase__status"><span>Not sent · due today</span><span>Not sent · 1 day late</span><span>Not sent · 2 days late</span><span>Not sent · 3 days late</span><span>Not sent · 4 days late</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h3 class="title">The reminder nobody sent</h3>
      <p>The documents were due on Tuesday. Everyone assumed someone else had chased them.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="pain pain--figures" data-reveal>
      <div class="pain__art art-figs" data-loop data-ui aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="art-figs__doc"><p>Rate sheet, March</p><b>20ft: ₹52,000</b></div>
        <div class="art-figs__doc"><p>Proposal template</p><b><span class="art-figs__mark"></span>20ft: ₹48,500</b><em>Doesn’t match</em></div>
      </div>
      <h3 class="title">Last year’s figures</h3>
      <p>The rate sheet changed in March. The proposal template didn’t, and a client spotted it first.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem { padding-top: var(--section); }
  .problem__top { row-gap: 28px; padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 6vw, 96px); }
  .problem__lead { max-width: 40ch; }

  .mosaic { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr)); grid-auto-rows: minmax(0, auto); }
  .mosaic__photo { grid-column: 1 / 7; grid-row: 1 / 3; position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: var(--surface-2); min-height: 100%; }
  .mosaic__photo :global(img) { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; filter: grayscale(1) contrast(1.05); }
  .mosaic__photo figcaption {
    position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: 0; max-width: 40ch; padding: 12px var(--margin) 14px;
    background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink);
  }

  .pain { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 44px); background: var(--surface); }
  .pain p { max-width: 38ch; }
  .pain__art { order: 3; position: relative; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 28px; height: 178px; font-size: 0.8125rem; line-height: 1.2; font-variation-settings: 'wdth' 82; font-weight: 500; }
  .pain--report { grid-column: 7 / -1; }
  .pain--chaser { grid-column: 7 / 10; background: var(--field); color: var(--on-field); }
  .pain--figures { grid-column: 10 / -1; background: var(--surface-2); }

  /* copy-paste loop */
  .art-copy { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; max-width: 460px; }
  .art-copy__rows li, .art-copy__mail i, .art-copy__mail p { height: 28px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding-inline: 8px; }
  .art-copy__rows li { background: var(--bg); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .art-copy__mail { background: var(--paper); color: var(--paper-ink); padding-block: 4px; }
  .art-copy__mail p { font-family: var(--font-doc); font-size: 0.9375rem; font-weight: 600; height: 24px; }
  .art-copy__mail i { display: block; height: 6px; margin: 11px 8px 0; background: var(--paper-ink); transform-origin: left; transform: scaleX(0); padding: 0; }
  .art-copy__mail i:nth-of-type(2) { width: 80%; }
  .art-copy__mail i:nth-of-type(3) { width: 60%; }
  .art-copy__track { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 28px; height: 28px; pointer-events: none; }
  .art-copy__chip { position: absolute; left: 10%; top: 4px; padding: 2px 8px; background: var(--accent); color: var(--on-accent); font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; }
  .is-playing .art-copy__track { animation: copy-move 6s var(--ease-in-out) infinite; }
  .is-playing .art-copy__mail i { animation: copy-line 6s steps(1, end) infinite; }
  .is-playing .art-copy__mail i:nth-of-type(2) { animation-delay: 2s; }
  .is-playing .art-copy__mail i:nth-of-type(3) { animation-delay: 4s; }
  @keyframes copy-move {
    0%, 6% { transform: translate(0, 0); }
    22%, 28% { transform: translate(52%, 30px); }
    36%, 39% { transform: translate(0, 34px); }
    55%, 61% { transform: translate(52%, 48px); }
    69%, 72% { transform: translate(0, 68px); }
    88%, 100% { transform: translate(52%, 64px); }
  }
  @keyframes copy-line { 0% { transform: scaleX(0); } 22% { transform: scaleX(1); } 96% { transform: scaleX(0); } }

  /* the chaser loop */
  .art-chase__days { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 4px; text-align: center; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .art-chase__days li { padding: 6px 0; }
  .art-chase__now { position: absolute; top: 30px; left: 0; width: calc((100% - 16px) / 5); height: 4px; background: var(--accent); }
  .art-chase__draft { margin-top: 18px; background: var(--paper); color: var(--paper-ink); padding: 10px 12px; }
  .art-chase__draft p { font-family: var(--font-doc); font-size: 0.9375rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .art-chase__status { height: 18px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 6px; color: var(--alert); font-weight: 700; }
  .art-chase__status span { display: block; height: 18px; }
  .is-playing .art-chase__now { animation: chase-day 7.5s steps(1, end) infinite; }
  .is-playing .art-chase__status span { animation: chase-status 7.5s steps(1, end) infinite; }
  @keyframes chase-day {
    0% { transform: translateX(calc(100% + 4px)); }
    20% { transform: translateX(calc(200% + 8px)); }
    40% { transform: translateX(calc(300% + 12px)); }
    60% { transform: translateX(calc(400% + 16px)); }
    80% { transform: translateX(calc(400% + 16px)); }
  }
  @keyframes chase-status {
    0% { transform: translateY(0); }
    20% { transform: translateY(-18px); }
    40% { transform: translateY(-36px); }
    60% { transform: translateY(-54px); }
    80% { transform: translateY(-72px); }
  }

  /* stale figures loop */
  .art-figs { display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  .art-figs__doc { background: var(--paper); color: var(--paper-ink); padding: 8px 12px; position: relative; }
  .art-figs__doc p { font-family: var(--font-doc); font-size: 0.875rem; }
  .art-figs__doc b { position: relative; display: inline-block; font-size: 1rem; font-variation-settings: 'wdth' 100; }
  .art-figs__mark { position: absolute; inset: -2px -4px; background: var(--del); z-index: -1; transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: left; }
  .art-figs__doc b { z-index: 0; isolation: isolate; }
  .art-figs__doc em { position: absolute; right: 10px; bottom: 9px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; color: var(--alert); opacity: 0; }
  .is-playing .art-figs__mark { animation: figs-mark 5s var(--ease-out) infinite; }
  .is-playing .art-figs__doc em { animation: figs-tag 5s var(--ease-out) infinite; }
  @keyframes figs-mark { 0%, 20% { transform: scaleX(0); } 40%, 90% { transform: scaleX(1); } 100% { transform: scaleX(0); } }
  @keyframes figs-tag { 0%, 38% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); } 48%, 90% { opacity: 1; transform: none; } 100% { opacity: 0; } }

  @media (max-width: 1099px) {
    .mosaic__photo { grid-column: 1 / -1; grid-row: auto; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; }
    .pain--report { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .pain--chaser { grid-column: 1 / 7; }
    .pain--figures { grid-column: 7 / -1; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .mosaic { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .mosaic > * { grid-column: 1 / -1 !important; }
    .mosaic__photo figcaption { position: static; padding-inline: var(--margin); }
    .mosaic__photo { aspect-ratio: auto; }
    .mosaic__photo :global(img) { aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; height: auto; }
    .pain { padding-inline: var(--margin); }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .pain__art * { animation: none !important; }
    .art-copy__mail i { transform: none; }
    .art-copy__chip { display: none; }
    .art-chase__now { transform: translateX(calc(300% + 12px)); }
    .art-chase__status span { transform: translateY(-36px); }
    .art-figs__mark { transform: none; }
    .art-figs__doc em { opacity: 1; }
  }
</style>

<script>
  import { playWhenVisible, drift } from '../lib/motion';
  playWhenVisible('[data-loop]');
  const photo = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.mosaic__photo')!;
  drift(photo.querySelector('img')!, photo);
</script>
